#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/sdk-docs/native-client-linux.tsx
msgid "Package status is <0>Implemented · verified locally</0>. cargo test passes 24 cases. Secret Service D-Bus storage and the full browser redirect flow require gnome-keyring or kwallet running on a desktop Linux system. Real IdP round-trip is pending manual verification. This page documents implemented behavior; it is not a production-readiness claim."
