#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID does not expose separate end-user registration and login products. Hosted Auth starts from the same identifier step and decides login or user creation from organization policy and account state."
msgstr "O XID não expõe produtos separados de registro e login para usuários finais. O Hosted Auth começa pela mesma etapa de identificador e decide login ou criação de usuário pela política da organização e pelo estado da conta."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID exposes inbound SCIM Service Provider endpoints for external IdPs. Downstream SaaS SCIM push clients have local fake-SaaS evidence, but production support still requires real SaaS admin L4."
msgstr "PT-BR: XID exposes inbound SCIM Service Provider endpoints for external IdPs. Downstream SaaS SCIM push clients have local fake-SaaS evidence, but production support still requires real SaaS admin L4."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID exposes organization-scoped SCIM 2.0 APIs under <0>/scim/v2/organizations/{organization_id}</0>. User and group resources are addressed with the organization ID in the path."
msgstr "XID expõe APIs SCIM 2.0 com escopo de organização em <0>/scim/v2/organizations/{organization_id}</0>. Recursos de usuários e grupos são endereçados com o ID da organização no caminho."

#: apps/server/src/lib/page-seo-messages.ts
msgid "XID is an edge-native identity platform for OIDC, OAuth, organization RBAC, enterprise SSO, SCIM, passkeys, and networkless JWT verification on Cloudflare."
msgstr "XID é uma plataforma de identidade edge nativa para OIDC, OAuth, RBAC organizacional, SSO empresarial, SCIM, passkeys e verificação JWT sem rede no Cloudflare.organizacional, SSO empresarial, SCIM, passkeys e verificação JWT sem rede no Cloudflare.organizacional, SSO empresarial, SCIM, passkeys e verificação JWT sem rede no Cloudflare."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID is an identity provider. The instance domain is the OIDC issuer, API base URL, Hosted Auth base URL, and console base URL. Organizations provide policy, branding, membership, and resource isolation."
msgstr "O XID é um provedor de identidade. O domínio da instância é o emissor OIDC, a URL base da API, a URL base do Hosted Auth e a URL base do console. As organizações fornecem política, identidade visual, associação e isolamento de recursos."

#: apps/server/src/routes/home/HeroSection.tsx
#~ msgid "XID is an OIDC / OAuth identity provider with explicit support levels, organization RBAC, provider-ready enterprise SAML/OIDC federation, inbound SCIM, local downstream SaaS SAML and SCIM baselines, and Web, Backend, React, and Next.js SDKs. It runs on Cloudflare's global network, while real provider and SaaS production support remains tied to L4 evidence instead of local mock runs."
#~ msgstr "PT-BR: XID is an OIDC / OAuth identity provider with explicit support levels, organization RBAC, provider-ready enterprise SAML/OIDC federation, inbound SCIM, local downstream SaaS SAML and SCIM baselines, and Web, Backend, React, and Next.js SDKs. It runs on Cloudflare's global network, while real provider and SaaS production support remains tied to L4 evidence instead of local mock runs."

#: apps/server/src/routes/home/PlatformSection.tsx
msgid "XID is the SAML SP or OIDC RP for upstream IdPs; SCIM 2.0 provisions users and groups in."
msgstr "O XID é o SP SAML ou o RP OIDC para IdPs upstream; o SCIM 2.0 provisiona usuários e grupos."

